------------------------------ MODULE Excluded ------------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals

VARIABLE x

Init == x = 0

Next == \/ x' = x + 1 /\ x' < 3
        \/ x' = (x + 2) % 5
        \/ x' = x

Small == x < 4

Step == x' # 3

Live == <>(x = 2)
